      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HALLEBESOFINE (6) is a consistent filly who has been racing well against the boys, winning second-up at Geelong last month before placing in the G3 Holmfield here last start. Had similar barriers to this in both of those outings and she looks suited back against the fillies. IJUSTCANTSEEIT (9) started favourite when resuming but manners let her down. Produced some good efforts last time in including a Kilmore win before the spell so she is worth another chance. ADELAIDE RED (7) hit her peak and scoring a 2m win when third-up last start, taking her strike rate at this circuit and distance to 50 per cent. Draws wider but she is a G1 winner here and with even luck she could go on with it. JILLIBY RADIANCE (5) is an exotic hope off a last-start placing from this barrier at Shepparton.",
